                        "review": "I played this in the Iphone and I bought it to play it again. \nThis game is story driven and unfinished as they tried to transform the game into a live service and failed. \nThis game you don't manage garrisons or level up, you are story driven and put in a situation with your resources to acomplish your objective. \n\nThe worst thing of this game is that the story doesn't finish and it will leave you a deep black abyss in your heart",
